{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "screenId": "component-demo",
  "title": "Demo kỹ thuật — liên kết gián tiếp {component}",
  "titleEn": "ENGINEERING DEMO — {component} INDIRECT BINDING",
  "theme": "blueprint",
  "layout": { "cols": 12, "rows": 6, "breakpoint": "panel" },
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": "probe-a",
      "kind": "readout",
      "component": "probe-temp",
      "rect": { "col": 0, "row": 0, "colSpan": 4, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "bindings": { "value": "{component}" }
    },
    {
      "id": "probe-b",
      "kind": "readout",
      "component": "probe-hum",
      "rect": { "col": 4, "row": 0, "colSpan": 4, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "bindings": { "value": "{component}" }
    },
    {
      "id": "direct-cycles",
      "kind": "readout",
      "rect": { "col": 8, "row": 0, "colSpan": 4, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "bindings": { "value": "cycles" }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-status-lamp",
      "kind": "status-lamp",
      "rect": { "col": 0, "row": 1, "colSpan": 3, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "props": { "label": "Đèn trạng thái", "sub": "status-lamp" }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-state-badge",
      "kind": "state-badge",
      "rect": { "col": 3, "row": 1, "colSpan": 3, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "bindings": { "state": "statusText" },
      "props": { "tones": { "TELEMETRY": "run", "OK": "run", "WARN": "warn", "FAIL": "fault", "Idle": "idle" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-line-state",
      "kind": "line-state",
      "rect": { "col": 6, "row": 1, "colSpan": 3, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "bindings": { "state": "statusText", "sub": "driftState" },
      "props": { "tones": { "TELEMETRY": "run", "OK": "run", "WARN": "warn", "FAIL": "fault", "Idle": "idle" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-log",
      "kind": "log",
      "rect": { "col": 9, "row": 1, "colSpan": 3, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "bindings": { "message": "keyMetric" }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-gauge",
      "kind": "gauge",
      "rect": { "col": 0, "row": 2, "colSpan": 4, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "bindings": { "value": "telemetry/temperature" },
      "props": { "label": "Nhiệt độ", "labelEn": "TEMPERATURE", "unit": "°C", "min": 0, "max": 60, "thresholds": { "warn": 30, "fault": 40 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-kpi-tile",
      "kind": "kpi-tile",
      "rect": { "col": 4, "row": 2, "colSpan": 4, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "bindings": { "value": "cycles", "sub": "statusText" },
      "props": { "label": "Chu kỳ", "labelEn": "CYCLES" }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-trend",
      "kind": "trend",
      "rect": { "col": 8, "row": 2, "colSpan": 4, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "bindings": { "series": "telemetry/humidity" },
      "props": { "label": "Độ ẩm", "unit": "%" }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-alarm-banner",
      "kind": "alarm-banner",
      "rect": { "col": 0, "row": 3, "colSpan": 6, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "props": {
        "__note": "NO BINDING, and that is measured rather than an omission. alarm-banner shows its message only while `active` resolves to boolean true or to a reading whose quality is \"bad\"; today no TagValueSource path can answer either. Its whole table (cycles, passRate, statusText, driftState, keyMetric, telemetry/{name}, code) returns numbers and strings, never a boolean, and the adapter deliberately never reports \"bad\" because MachineDetail carries no fault signal to base it on -- pinned by runtime-tests/tagValueSource.test.mjs. So this widget can only ever render its quiet default here, and it does. A `message` binding to statusText stood here until task-6-review.md LOW-1: the widget computes that value and then discards it unless `active` is truthy, so it could never reach the DOM. Removed rather than left looking wired. When a TagValueSource gains a boolean or a real quality signal, bind `active` and delete this note."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-alarm-list",
      "kind": "alarm-list",
      "rect": { "col": 6, "row": 3, "colSpan": 6, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "bindings": { "drift": "driftState" },
      "props": {
        "rows": [{ "id": "drift", "label": "Lệch cấu hình", "labelEn": "CONFIG DRIFT", "binding": "drift" }],
        "__note": "The row below IS live -- the binding is read on every render and the row is drawn -- but its RAISED state is unreachable from this document today, and that is measured, not assumed (task-6-review.md LOW-1). alarm-list raises a row only when its reading is boolean true or has quality \"bad\"; driftState is a string whose quality is \"good\" or \"stale\", and no TagValueSource path returns a boolean or ever reports \"bad\" (see kind-alarm-banner's note above for the same measurement). So the quiet row is the only state this screen can show. Left bound rather than removed: unlike the banner, this widget really does read the value and really does draw the row."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-setpoint-input",
      "kind": "setpoint-input",
      "rect": { "col": 0, "row": 4, "colSpan": 3, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "bindings": { "value": "telemetry/temperature" },
      "policyAction": "machine.setpoint",
      "props": { "label": "Điểm đặt (demo)", "labelEn": "SETPOINT — DEMO, NO WRITE", "unit": "°C" }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-command-button",
      "kind": "command-button",
      "rect": { "col": 3, "row": 4, "colSpan": 3, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "policyAction": "machine.command",
      "props": { "variant": "start", "label": "Nút lệnh (demo)", "labelEn": "COMMAND — DEMO, NO DISPATCH" }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-label",
      "kind": "label",
      "rect": { "col": 6, "row": 4, "colSpan": 3, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "props": { "text": "Nhãn tĩnh", "textEn": "STATIC LABEL" }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-sheet",
      "kind": "sheet",
      "rect": { "col": 9, "row": 4, "colSpan": 3, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "props": { "title": "Khung nhóm", "titleEn": "GROUPING FRAME" }
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-faceplate",
      "kind": "faceplate",
      "rect": { "col": 0, "row": 5, "colSpan": 12, "rowSpan": 1 },
      "props": { "faceplate": "fp.overview.iot", "schematicFlex": 0.85, "readoutFlex": 1.15 }
    }
  ]
}
